+Unreleased
+----------
+
+* Add :func:`adrt.core.gram`, the normal operator :math:`R^T R`
+  applied row by row in the offset-frequency domain
+* Add :func:`adrt.core.lstsq_cheb`, a fixed-degree Chebyshev
