diff --git a/docs/reference.core.rst b/docs/reference.core.rst
index 0a15728..11b60da 100644
--- a/docs/reference.core.rst
+++ b/docs/reference.core.rst
@@ -55,3 +55,18 @@ for OpenMP. The function :func:`threading_enabled` queries whether
 this support is enabled.
 
 .. autofunction:: threading_enabled
+
+Normal Operator and Least Squares
+---------------------------------
+
+The normal operator :math:`R^T R` of the ADRT can be applied without
+forming the transform pair: after a Fourier transform in the offset,
+each quadrant is block diagonal with one butterfly matrix per offset
+frequency, and :func:`gram` applies their Gram matrices row by row.
+:func:`lstsq_cheb` uses it in a fixed-degree Chebyshev polynomial for
+the normal equations, a least-squares inverse whose cost is set in
+advance by a spectral interval.
+
+.. autofunction:: gram
+
+.. autofunction:: lstsq_cheb
